-- en: "Matches when the selected unit is dead or a ghost. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable, including under NOT. In a Via Macro announcement, choose Announcement target to follow the supplied unit."
L["Matches when the selected unit is dead or a ghost. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable, including under NOT. In a Via Macro announcement, choose Announcement target to follow the supplied unit."] = "Correspond lorsque l'unité sélectionnée est morte ou fantôme. Une unité manquante ou illisible est indisponible, y compris sous NOT. Dans une annonce Via macro, choisissez Cible de l'annonce pour suivre l'unité fournie."
-- en: "Matches when the game reports the selected unit as friendly to you. This does not imply party or raid membership. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable."
L["Matches when the game reports the selected unit as friendly to you. This does not imply party or raid membership. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable."] = "Correspond lorsque le jeu indique que l'unité sélectionnée vous est amicale. Cela n'implique pas l'appartenance au groupe ou au raid. Une unité manquante ou illisible est indisponible."
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"] = "L'Assistant de combat {{!suggère un sort|ne suggère aucun sort}}"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"
L["Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"] = "L'Assistant de combat {{!suggère|ne suggère pas}} %s"
-- en: "Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."
L["Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."] = "Correspond lorsque l'Assistant de combat de Blizzard suggère ce sort comme prochaine incantation. Une variante de remplacement compte comme son sort de base, et le sort de base comme sa variante. Sans sort choisi, correspond chaque fois que l'Assistant de combat suggère quoi que ce soit."
-- en: "Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "L'Assistant de combat existe sur Retail (et est déclaré sur Forever). Là où le jeu ne le propose pas, pour ce personnage ou cette spécialisation, ou si la suggestion ne peut pas être lue, cette condition est indisponible plutôt que fausse, y compris sous NOT."
-- en: "%s {{!is|is not}} in Blizzard's Assisted Combat rotation"
L["%s {{!is|is not}} in Blizzard's Assisted Combat rotation"] = "%s {{!est|n'est pas}} dans la rotation de l'Assistant de combat de Blizzard"
-- en: "Matches when this spell is one Blizzard's Assisted Combat can suggest for your current specialization. Its current override and its base spell count too. Use it to highlight what Assisted Combat leaves out, for example a cooldown that is not in the set."
L["Matches when this spell is one Blizzard's Assisted Combat can suggest for your current specialization. Its current override and its base spell count too. Use it to highlight what Assisted Combat leaves out, for example a cooldown that is not in the set."] = "Correspond quand ce sort est l'un de ceux que l'Assistant de combat de Blizzard peut suggérer pour votre spécialisation actuelle. Son remplacement actuel et son sort de base comptent aussi. Utilisez-la pour mettre en surbrillance ce que l'Assistant de combat laisse de côté, par exemple un temps de recharge qui ne fait pas partie de l'ensemble."
-- en: "The set is read again whenever your spells change, never guessed. Where the game does not offer Assisted Combat for this character or specialization, or the set cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["The set is read again whenever your spells change, never guessed. Where the game does not offer Assisted Combat for this character or specialization, or the set cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "L'ensemble est relu chaque fois que vos sorts changent, jamais deviné. Quand le jeu ne propose pas l'Assistant de combat pour ce personnage ou cette spécialisation, ou que l'ensemble est illisible, cette condition est indisponible plutôt que fausse, y compris sous NOT."
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} available"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} available"] = "L'Assistant de combat {{!est|n'est pas}} disponible"
-- en: "Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."
L["Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."] = "Correspond quand le jeu propose l'Assistant de combat de Blizzard pour votre personnage et votre spécialisation actuelle. Quand ce n'est pas le cas (par exemple une spécialisation pour laquelle Blizzard n'a pas de rotation d'Assistant de combat, ou un client qui déclare l'API mais ne propose pas la fonctionnalité), elle est fausse, si bien qu'une branche peut se rabattre sur vos propres étapes."
-- en: "Unavailable only where the client has no Assisted Combat API or its answer cannot be read, including under NOT."
L["Unavailable only where the client has no Assisted Combat API or its answer cannot be read, including under NOT."] = "Indisponible uniquement quand le client n'a pas l'API de l'Assistant de combat ou que sa réponse est illisible, y compris sous NOT."
